{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Age of Respair",
    "steam_appid": 3164360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/402a48b2caa393fc7198996d264fdf7d.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/402a48b2caa393fc7198996d264fdf7d.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/402a48b2caa393fc7198996d264fdf7d.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Age of Respair</strong> is a strategy castle builder where you'll manage every aspect of your kingdom: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Gather resources</strong> and establish production chains.<br></li><li><strong>Grow population</strong> to expand your castle and economy.<br></li><li><strong>Strengthen defenses</strong> to survive relentless sieges.<br></li><li><strong>Build massive armies</strong> to storm enemy castles.</li></ul><br>Play a <strong>story-driven campaign</strong> or engage in intense <strong>skirmishes against AI opponents</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/a27b1a2a340fe3f59766dff69999e3be.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/23ce184a0eaae55114ee50af1a54b300.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/23ce184a0eaae55114ee50af1a54b300.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/23ce184a0eaae55114ee50af1a54b300.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Gather essential resources like <strong>wood, stone, and iron</strong>. Workers collect these resources and deliver them to your stockpile, making them available for use in production chains. Don\u2019t forget to feed your population - choose between quick options like <strong>apple farms</strong> or build more reliable food systems, such as <strong>wheat fields</strong> that supply to <strong>mills and bakeries</strong>. Every decision shapes the prosperity of your kingdom.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/5e8ff8b739482b90551e5e9dfaa0df76.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/8e093829489f72fcf56f3da6964469e6.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/8e093829489f72fcf56f3da6964469e6.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/8e093829489f72fcf56f3da6964469e6.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Managing your population\u2019s happiness is essential for maintaining a thriving kingdom. If your people are unhappy, they\u2019ll abandon their work and even your castle. Build <strong>churches, taverns</strong>, and <strong>decorations</strong> to boost morale, but be careful - more people means more buildings to keep them content. <br>Alternatively, you can rule through fear by placing intimidating structures like <strong>torture machines</strong>, increasing productivity at the cost of happiness. Balance your reputation wisely: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Happier citizens</strong> pay more taxes.<br></li><li><strong>Fear</strong> can drive higher resource production.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/ad58f6c5a39139d5abc9e0d28f0b0383.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/7ad8e73441fe7ebb6b3570389d779538.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/7ad8e73441fe7ebb6b3570389d779538.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/7ad8e73441fe7ebb6b3570389d779538.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As your kingdom grows, so do your needs. Start with basic buildings and <strong>upgrade them</strong> to improve efficiency, ensuring your economy scales with your ambitions. Strategic upgrades are key to maintaining a robust and thriving economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/2403d63045b28bc945dd00dcdbab52d4.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/34cb4ce3b3c511ccba8bb2d486b49e6b.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/34cb4ce3b3c511ccba8bb2d486b49e6b.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/34cb4ce3b3c511ccba8bb2d486b49e6b.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fortify your defenses with strong walls, strategic towers, and deep moats to safeguard your kingdom from enemy invasions. <strong>Protect your king</strong> at all costs.<br>Once your defenses are secure, shift focus to your offensive strategy. <strong>Produce weapons, train soldiers</strong>, and deploy siege machines like <strong>ballistas, catapults,</strong> and <strong>siege towers</strong> to conquer enemy castles. With the <strong>fog of war</strong> hiding enemy locations, careful scouting and strategic planning are essential for victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/1424ee621e8c7e92abf2c4fb7b8755fe.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Join our <strong>Discord</strong> to connect with us, share your thoughts, and be the first to experience the game in <strong>alpha</strong> and <strong>beta</strong> stages. Help us shape the game and connect with fellow enthusiasts as we build something amazing together.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/402a48b2caa393fc7198996d264fdf7d.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/402a48b2caa393fc7198996d264fdf7d.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/402a48b2caa393fc7198996d264fdf7d.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Age of Respair</strong> is a strategy castle builder where you'll manage every aspect of your kingdom: <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Gather resources</strong> and establish production chains.<br></li><li><strong>Grow population</strong> to expand your castle and economy.<br></li><li><strong>Strengthen defenses</strong> to survive relentless sieges.<br></li><li><strong>Build massive armies</strong> to storm enemy castles.</li></ul><br>Play a <strong>story-driven campaign</strong> or engage in intense <strong>skirmishes against AI opponents</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/a27b1a2a340fe3f59766dff69999e3be.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/23ce184a0eaae55114ee50af1a54b300.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/23ce184a0eaae55114ee50af1a54b300.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/23ce184a0eaae55114