</strong> pay more taxes.<br></li><li><strong>Fear</strong> can drive higher resource production.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/ad58f6c5a39139d5abc9e0d28f0b0383.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/7ad8e73441fe7ebb6b3570389d779538.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/7ad8e73441fe7ebb6b3570389d779538.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/7ad8e73441fe7ebb6b3570389d779538.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As your kingdom grows, so do your needs. Start with basic buildings and <strong>upgrade them</strong> to improve efficiency, ensuring your economy scales with your ambitions. Strategic upgrades are key to maintaining a robust and thriving economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/2403d63045b28bc945dd00dcdbab52d4.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/34cb4ce3b3c511ccba8bb2d486b49e6b.poster.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/34cb4ce3b3c511ccba8bb2d486b49e6b.webm?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/34cb4ce3b3c511ccba8bb2d486b49e6b.mp4?t=1733064232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fortify your defenses with strong walls, strategic towers, and deep moats to safeguard your kingdom from enemy invasions. <strong>Protect your king</strong> at all costs.<br>Once your defenses are secure, shift focus to your offensive strategy. <strong>Produce weapons, train soldiers</strong>, and deploy siege machines like <strong>ballistas, catapults,</strong> and <strong>siege towers</strong> to conquer enemy castles. With the <strong>fog of war</strong> hiding enemy locations, careful scouting and strategic planning are essential for victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164360/extras/1424ee621e8c7e92abf2c4fb7b8755fe.avif?t=1733064232\" width=616 height=90 /></span><br>Join our <strong>Discord</strong> to connect with us, share your thoughts, and be the first to experience the game in <strong>alpha</strong> and <strong>beta</strong> stages. Help us shape the game and connect with fellow enthusiasts as we build something amazing together.",
